{"id":1251,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;近日，学院首个职工创新工作室完成结项合格验收。依托现有成熟的建设运营经验，学院同步启动第二个创新工作室的培育规划，新工作室聚焦心理健康疏导方向开展建设。后续学院将构筑双阵地育人格局，一边深耕乡村音乐支教，一边筑牢师生心理关怀体系，多层次拓展育人实践路径。</p><table bordercolor=\"transparent\" imgborderradius=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VMR-2iLRQ7L8r2Ldm9DMm-4nRlDUmU-8U4CPLN-bolQ7L490gihFp2hmCIa0oky8U1hfL1yaL87DnzLbnRLYMRT2nNCZMlVfLzlaMN-4LmnFnRn2nmNPM8VFM4rknl7Jqjfjo4OeoDbT6DVY6khXptQ0g4-aLRN0Lm7YLRlJqdWnx&oid=2004969448&tid=2009&nid=21205&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"false\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/84BA203A6E39D3249FFF85AA1506B324/D4FF917A/75BEA\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VL8Q27M8laM47ZLd467nRL4LmlPLzN-4Lz9sLNUbnmr7UzU0gihFp2hmCIa0UYyYUYh2LYyYL4Tfo7LPL4vDMz94Lz74n77bM8LbLRl4MRTFU4lZnmNaozWFMNUPM462gtXaQ4Oeo4xJQ56AvjU0qIbtpYyYLRGbg4-PLmGigtA8pUWcc&oid=2004969448&tid=2009&nid=21205&e=.jpg\"></div></td><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Vn7V2fMRC8M4WfLd77iL7W7oRWkLzr-7o7Caoz9aMmQ7nzl0gihFp2hmCIa0LkyPL1yiMYyinz62o7UDUmQfoRfVL4L8L4vaL4WRnRCDnRQFMmUZnmQ7M4TFMlC8LRLJqjfjo4OeoDbT6DVY6khXptQ0g4-aLRN0Lm7YLRlJqdWnx&oid=2004969448&tid=2009&nid=21205&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"false\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/012575E7F8D6B6A80E33437032CD66D6/648F6D79/5F403\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VUl72ZLmNbnmAVUdzvanNCYMmMRLzT-2o7MVLzCPn7M2Mm90gihFp2hmCIa0LYybn1hVLSyDo7V7L4G8ozviUzUan7lPL7nkUNn7MmN4MmVFL7CsL4TknznFUlQRMNM7gtXaQ4Oeo4xJQ56AvjU0qIbtpYyYLRGbg4-PLmGigtA8pUWcc&oid=2004969448&tid=2009&nid=21205&e=.jpg\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 新工作室——“屿•ILSET”以积极心理学为理论基础，将十大主题与多元戏剧演绎深度联结。通过即兴戏剧的自发互动激活情绪觉察与内在优势，利用论坛戏剧让参与者介入剧情推演沟通策略；借助过程戏剧构建情境探索自我认同等深层议题，并穿插戏剧游戏降低心理防御、建立信任场域。新工作室已经完成四期活动，分别为：与自己和解、情绪小怪兽、如果能重来、友谊的界限。四期活动有效缓解了师生学业压力与心理焦虑。进一步夯实心理健康育人阵地，营造积极阳光、健康向上的校园氛围，切实提升师生心理韧性与自我调节能力，筑牢校园心理健康安全防线。</p><table bordercolor=\"transparent\" imgborderradius=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VozC28nlr2olLsodzTkM4A7nzV2Mz--ZLRT2ozvDLmv8nzU0gihFp2hmCIa0okybnShfnSyPUN-bU8-8nl7PLmA2nmLiMzr7UmL4oz9ioRWFozCaUzGDnzMFM87DnRUJv2bjo4OeoDbT6DVY6khXptQ0g4-aLRN0Lm7YLRlJqdWnx&oid=2004969448&tid=2009&nid=21205&e=.png\" draggable=\"false\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/89EAE1BB9CB4EA128FF3555DB3398582/960A06E3/7A6D4\" vheight=\" 642px\" vwidth=\" 423px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VozC28nlr2olLsodzTkM4A7nzV2Mz--ZLRT2ozvDLmv8nzU0gihFp2hmCIa0okybnShfnSyPUN-bU8-8nl7PLmA2nmLiMzr7UmL4oz9ioRWFozCaUzGDnzMFM87DnRUJv2bjo4OeoDbT6DVY6khXptQ0g4-aLRN0Lm7YLRlJqdWnx&oid=2004969448&tid=2009&nid=21205&e=.png\"></div></td><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VL4627UzWkolQRUd8Q2L87bo7CanzU-iUml4UzM7LzrfL7U0gihFp2hmCIa0LkhVn1hRnkhfM4UDnNVknzCsLlUZMlnVLRV7MNn7MzNaUNMFL8VRUmUPolVFMR7ZM7UJv2bjo4OeoDbT6DVY6khXptQ0g4-aLRN0Lm7YLRlJqdWnx&oid=2004969448&tid=2009&nid=21205&e=.png\" draggable=\"false\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/0EFCDA746FABE671D85DE01D6DD590BC/3ACB419A/4184D\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VL4627UzWkolQRUd8Q2L87bo7CanzU-iUml4UzM7LzrfL7U0gihFp2hmCIa0LkhVn1hRnkhfM4UDnNVknzCsLlUZMlnVLRV7MNn7MzNaUNMFL8VRUmUPolVFMR7ZM7UJv2bjo4OeoDbT6DVY6khXptQ0g4-aLRN0Lm7YLRlJqdWnx&oid=2004969448&tid=2009&nid=21205&e=.png\"></div></td></tr><tr><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VozC2iMzTknR7ZLdlrRLmAfo7UaLR9-PMz7sMl7YLNQ2n7U0gihFp2hmCIa0UYhVLShVLYybM7lsoRTRM8r2Lm98nllanzf2LRTRLRWVMzfFM77ZM8-ZnRAFMRV7L8lJv2bjo4OeoDbT6DVY6khXptQ0g4-aLRN0Lm7YLRlJqdWnx&oid=2004969448&tid=2009&nid=21205&e=.png\" draggable=\"false\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/CE1E394E789C7EF284EE0E0F09C02E50/4A87B8D8/41D3E\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VozC2iMzTknR7ZLdlrRLmAfo7UaLR9-PMz7sMl7YLNQ2n7U0gihFp2hmCIa0UYhVLShVLYybM7lsoRTRM8r2Lm98nllanzf2LRTRLRWVMzfFM77ZM8-ZnRAFMRV7L8